        "TileImage": "$($repository 26bb164c-282d-4bce-b8a4-cbaa2da73432).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47.\r\rYour target is an intelligence operative working out of a market in Marrakesh, Morocco. The target has previously hindered or even compromised operatives working in the area.\r\rThe target&apos;s cover is a stallholder in the market. Intel suggests that he will attempt to follow if you get his attention, providing ample opportunity. The client requests that the target be eliminated execution-style, with a bullet to the head, to send a message.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
